OL,3,AFlights and train services cancelled in
OL,4,ABelgium due to strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of flights have been cancelled
OL,7,Fand public transport severely disrupted
OL,8,Facross Belgium as a result of a strike
OL,9,Fagainst planned austerity measures.
OL,11,FAll air traffic has been halted at
OL,12,FBrussels Airport in Zaventem as well as
OL,13,Fat Charleroi, home to low-cost airlines
OL,14,Fsuch as Ryanair.
OL,16,FUnderground services have also been
OL,17,Fhalted in capital Brussels, where large
OL,18,Fnumbers of people joined a protest
OL,19,Fmarch.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
